              <li><strong>Mentorship emerges:</strong> For those who&apos;ve done the work, the second return often marks a shift from learning to teaching {"—"} sharing the genuine wisdom (not just the clever observations) you&apos;ve accumulated. Saturn rewards the Gemini who can finally say something simple and true after decades of saying things that were complex and performed.</li>
